# sketch: graph Y₁ on the analysis window, mark the important points
# box=max/min/crit  +=inflection  dot=intercept/hole, lines=asymptotes
{0}→L₁
0→J
a+b𝑖
For(I,1,dim(ʟEX))
ʟET(I)→T
If T=10 or T=21 or T=30 or T=31 or T=40 or T=41
Then
Y₁(ʟEX(I)+1ᴇ⁻7*(T=21))→B
If imag(B)=0
Then
J+1→J
real(B)→L₁(J)
End
End
End
Real
For(I,2,dim(ʟHA))
J+1→J
ʟHA(I)→L₁(J)
End
If J=0
1→J
J→dim(L₁)
max(1,max(L₁)-min(L₁))→C
min(L₁)-.35C→A
max(L₁)+.35C→B
min(A,⁻.5)→A
max(B,.5)→B
FnOff
FnOn 1
PlotsOff
ʟWN(1)→Xmin
ʟWN(2)→Xmax
A→Ymin
B→Ymax
(ʟWN(2)-ʟWN(1))/10→Xscl
(B-A)/10→Yscl
ClrDraw
Real
DispGraph
For(I,1,dim(ʟEX))
ʟET(I)→T
ʟEX(I)→X
If T=20
Vertical X
If T=10 or T=21 or T=30 or T=31 or T=40 or T=41
Then
a+b𝑖
Y₁(X+1ᴇ⁻7*(T=21))→D
Real
If imag(D)=0 and real(D)≥A and real(D)≤B
Then
real(D)→D
If T=10 or T=21
Pt-On(X,D,1)
If T=30 or T=31
Pt-On(X,D,2)
If T=40 or T=41
Pt-On(X,D,3)
End
End
End
For(I,2,dim(ʟHA))
If ʟHA(I)≥A and ʟHA(I)≤B
Horizontal ʟHA(I)
End
Pause
ClrHome
Disp "GRAPH: PRESS","GRAPH/TRACE TO","SEE IT AGAIN","(F IS IN Y1)"
Pause
ClrHome
